WEBVTT

00:07:57.640 --> 00:08:01.894
and they revise their plans
to efficiently meet expected demand

00:08:01.936 --> 00:08:03.979
with a steady stream of supply.

00:08:04.021 --> 00:08:07.650
Supply-chain control towers bring
all of that information into one place,

00:08:07.691 --> 00:08:10.444
and better data should help
better decision-making.

00:08:10.986 --> 00:08:13.489
But too much data
can simply be overwhelming,

00:08:13.489 --> 00:08:15.658
and that's why we need
technology to help us.

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:19.078
The good news is that advances
in data mining,

00:08:19.119 --> 00:08:22.039
artificial intelligence
and machine learning

00:08:22.081 --> 00:08:24.250
increasingly mean
that computers can help us

00:08:24.291 --> 00:08:27.211
analyze thousands or millions
of points of data,

00:08:27.211 --> 00:08:30.965
predict problems
before they arise, notify managers